{#
mail/_read_receipt.stream.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Swaps the receipt region for its re-decided self after the reader answered the
prompt.

A replace of the whole region rather than a remove of the prompt: sending and
dismissing both write the same flag, and re-rendering the partial is what makes
the answer come from the policy rather than from this template guessing what
the answer was.
#}
<turbo-stream action="replace" target="read_receipt_{{ message.id }}">
    <template>
        {% include 'mail/_read_receipt.html.twig' with { message: message } only %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
